PN,36401
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785851301
OL,3,CMajor incidents stood down as severe
OL,4,Cmoorland wildfires 'contained'
OL,6,FMajor incidents declared across parts
OL,7,Fof the North West of England have been
OL,8,Fofficially stood down following weeks
OL,9,Fof intense efforts to tackle severe
OL,10,Fmoorland blazes.
OL,12,FEmergency services have confirmed that
OL,13,F"significant progress" has been made,
OL,14,Fwith fires near Dovestone and Swinshaw
OL,15,Fin Greater Manchester now "largely
OL,16,Fcontained" and the risk of further
OL,17,Fspread substantially reduced.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/6
