FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785851301
OL,3,CMajor incidents stood down as severe
OL,4,Cmoorland wildfires 'contained'
OL,6,FHundreds of firefighters have worked
OL,7,F"tirelessly" since the blazes first
OL,8,Fbroke out on 11 July, following weeks
OL,9,Fof hot and extremely dry weather in
OL,10,Fthe region.
OL,12,FIt is believed the fire at Dovestone
OL,13,Fwas started after a firework was let
OL,14,Foff nearby.
OL,16,FDespite the lifting of major incident
OL,17,Fstatus, authorities warn that the
OL,18,Fsituation across the moorland remains
OL,19,Fdelicate.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785851301
OL,3,CMajor incidents stood down as severe
OL,4,Cmoorland wildfires 'contained'
OL,6,FDeep-seated fires are still burning
OL,7,Fbeneath the surface, meaning crews
OL,8,Fwill remain on scene to monitor
OL,9,Fremaining hotspots and assist with
OL,10,Frecovery efforts.
OL,12,FTo prevent further risks, emergency
OL,13,Fservices are asking the public to stay
OL,14,Faway from all affected moorland and to
OL,15,Fensure emergency access routes remain
OL,16,Fclear.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785851301
OL,3,CMajor incidents stood down as severe
OL,4,Cmoorland wildfires 'contained'
OL,6,FVisitors are also being urged to help
OL,7,Fprevent new fires by strictly
OL,8,Frefraining from using BBQs, campfires,
OL,9,Ffireworks, or any naked flames on or
OL,10,Fnear the moors.
OL,12,FA second major incident declared near
OL,13,FGlossop has also been stood down by
OL,14,FDerbyshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,15,F(DFRS), though officials stress that
OL,16,FTintwistle Moor remains an active
OL,17,Fincident with ongoing work on site.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785851301
OL,3,CMajor incidents stood down as severe
OL,4,Cmoorland wildfires 'contained'
OL,6,FThe wildfire, first reported in June,
OL,7,Fwas initially declared a major
OL,8,Fincident on Sunday, 12 July, due to
OL,9,Fits scale, complexity, and the
OL,10,Frequirement for a coordinated multi-
OL,11,Fagency response.
OL,13,FEmergency services confirmed there are
OL,14,Fcurrently no active flames, and the
OL,15,Foperation is nearing the end of its
OL,16,Fresponse phase before transitioning
OL,17,Finto a monitoring and recovery phase.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785851301
OL,3,CMajor incidents stood down as severe
OL,4,Cmoorland wildfires 'contained'
OL,6,FIn a statement, DFRS said: "The fire
OL,7,Fremains contained and, encouragingly,
OL,8,Fno flames have been observed since
OL,9,Flast week."
OL,11,FA fire service presence will remain on
OL,12,Fthe moors for some time to support
OL,13,Fthese recovery efforts and safely
OL,14,Fretrieve a significant amount of
OL,15,Fequipment from the area.
OL,17,F"We would like to thank our
OL,18,Ffirefighters, partner agencies,
OL,19,Flandowners, local communities and
OL,20,Feveryone who has supported the
OL,21,Fresponse throughout this incident."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
